abstract: >-
  Dated, source-linked ordinary first-offense ticket schedule references and
  county court traffic-school fee observations in California. This edition
  includes 49 ticket references across six counties and 25 court fee observations.
  The license covers original curation and annotations. The issuing court
  determines the amount due and eligibility in an individual case.
